# Test: the built le personality runs the eleven rules-corpus gates over the
# accept-only: the registered native fixture enforces this scenario's behavioral contract
# real checkout, reports each gate's contract, and exposes every verdict as
# structured data. Writing gates operate only in fixture-owned trees.
#
# The timeout covers a cold cmd/ze build cache and the point round trip's large
# scratch population.

option=timeout:value=420s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze-test fixture ui/le-rules-answers
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=OK
